{"title":"1998 CEMC Cayley Problems/Problem 3","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The expression <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/b/c/abc33f379d02587e8408570b298c8dc6627c8c0b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{a^{9} \\times a^{15}}{a^{3}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"69\" height=\"41\" /> is equal to\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/f/fcf0f8c1850e537ed311a3e7fed8c10c90f263cd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{ (A) }\\ a^{45} \\qquad\\text{ (B) }\\ a^{8} \\qquad\\text{ (C) }\\ a^{18} \\qquad\\text{ (D) }\\ a^{14} \\qquad\\text{ (E) }\\ a^{21}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"454\" height=\"21\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/1/6/11603ab6c79a6a801063f7e1bb759c2250a7608a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a^{b} \\times a^{c} = a^{b + c}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"113\" height=\"19\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/9/c79c0aff7b106389d12004e5e07af88327d25f93.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{a^{b}}{a^{c}} = a^{b - c}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"79\" height=\"41\" /> if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/7/a/67a8181c9d9b8253bd721b620aaabc5b01f4af96.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a \\neq 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"45\" height=\"18\" />, so we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/9/7c9e0f215ba25aa58698edbc543648afbf6e7170.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{a^{9} \\times a^{15}}{a^{3}} = \\frac{a^{9 + 15}}{a^{3}} = \\frac{a^{24}}{a^{3}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"189\" height=\"41\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/a/b/1ab44066b02b4eac760b522b22ab0cc1160170a6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=a^{24 - 3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"62\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/8/7c8be687279fab9be7251704b9733a1b30df170e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=\\boxed {\\textbf {(E) } a^{21}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"90\" height=\"32\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_CEMC_Cayley\" title=\"1998 CEMC Cayley\">1998 CEMC Cayley</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_CEMC_Cayley_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"1998 CEMC Cayley Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_CEMC_Cayley_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"1998 CEMC Cayley Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1998 CEMC Cayley Problems/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1998 CEMC Cayley Problems/